// Pull request author: swachchhanda000
// Change: new rule
// Title: Potential Third-Party Antivirus Protection Disabled Via Registry
// Sigma ID: 1c486b8b-0357-4589-930b-1671314462e3
// Status: experimental | Level: high
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems), Swachchhanda Shrawan Poudel (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2026-08-14 | Modified: -
// ATT&CK: defense-impairment, T1685
// Description: Detects registry modifications that disable antivirus protection or self-defense mechanisms of
//   common third-party security products. Ransomware and targeted attackers commonly disable these
//   protections before deploying their payload to prevent the AV from blocking or removing malicious
//   activity.
// False positives:
//   - Some FP may occur when the feature is disabled by the AV itself, you should always investigate if the action was legitimate
// References:
//   - https://github.com/Siradankullanici/OpenSourceViruses/blob/3267564a35f6e13559a3119eb68d0da8d2e91a0a/suspiciousregchangesandtaskkils
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/e6fa05ce10d4092a1de7d7380da240a34a30b555/rules/windows/registry/registry_set/registry_set_third_party_av_tamper.yml
// License: Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1 - https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License
// Converted by sigma2kql (target: microsoft_xdr, pySigma 1.5.1, pySigma-backend-kusto 1.0.1)
// Validation: passed (Kusto.Language, Defender schema)
// Machine-generated and not tested against real telemetry. Verify before use as a detection.

DeviceRegistryEvents
| where (RegistryKey contains "\\SOFTWARE\\AVAST Software\\Avast\\aswidsagenta" and RegistryValueData =~ "DWORD (0x00000000)") or (RegistryKey contains "\\SOFTWARE\\AVG\\DisableAv" and RegistryValueData =~ "DWORD (0x00000001)") or (RegistryKey contains "\\SOFTWARE\\Avira\\ProductEnabled" and RegistryValueData =~ "DWORD (0x00000000)") or (RegistryKey contains "\\SOFTWARE\\Bitdefender\\BlockUserModeAccess" and RegistryValueData =~ "DWORD (0x00000001)") or ((RegistryKey contains "\\SOFTWARE\\ESET\\ESET Security\\ProtectEnabled" or RegistryKey contains "\\SOFTWARE\\ESET\\ESET Security\\EnableHIPS") and RegistryValueData =~ "DWORD (0x00000000)") or (RegistryKey contains "\\SOFTWARE\\KasperskyLab\\Enable" and RegistryValueData =~ "DWORD (0x00000000)") or (RegistryKey contains "\\SOFTWARE\\Malwarebytes\\MalwareProtectionEnabled" and RegistryValueData =~ "DWORD (0x00000000)") or (RegistryKey contains "\\SOFTWARE\\McAfee\\bDisableSelfProtection" and RegistryValueData =~ "DWORD (0x00000001)") or (RegistryKey contains "\\SOFTWARE\\Norton\\Enable" and RegistryValueData =~ "DWORD (0x00000000)") or ((RegistryKey contains "\\Sophos Endpoint Defense\\TamperProtection\\Config\\SAVEnabled" or RegistryKey contains "\\Sophos Endpoint Defense\\TamperProtection\\Config\\SEDEnabled" or RegistryKey contains "\\Sophos\\SAVService\\TamperProtection\\Enabled") and RegistryValueData =~ "DWORD (0x00000000)")
